      </li> <li> <para-num num="[0033]"> </para-num> <div id="p-0034" num="0033" class="description-line"> <figref idrefs="DRAWINGS">FIG. 10</figref>. SEM Cross Sectional Micrograph of 7 μm PP/PE/PP Trilayer Microporous Membrane at 8,500 Magnification.</div>
      </li> <li> <para-num num="[0034]"> </para-num> <div id="p-0035" num="0034" class="description-line"> <figref idrefs="DRAWINGS">FIG. 11</figref>. SEM Cross Sectional Micrograph of 8 μm PP/PE/PP Trilayer Microporous Membrane at 8,550 Magnification.</div>
      </li> <li> <para-num num="[0035]"> </para-num> <div id="p-0036" num="0035" class="description-line"> <figref idrefs="DRAWINGS">FIG. 12</figref>. SEM Cross Sectional Micrograph of 8 μm PP/PE/PP Trilayer Microporous Membrane at 8,500 Magnification.</div>
